<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Tech Launch Resume | Modern Frontend Systems Engineering</title>
    <style>
        /* =========================================================
           GLOBAL (ULTRA-LIGHT SOFT BLUE / GRAY PALETTE)
        ========================================================= */
        :root {
            --background: #f1f5f9;
            --background-card: #ffffff;
            --surface-subtle: #f8fafc;
            --border: #cbd5e1;
            --border-light: #e2e8f0;
            --text-main: #0f172a;
            --text-muted: #334155;
            --accent-primary: #0284c7;
            --accent-soft: #e0f2fe;
            --accent-dark: #0369a1;
            --code-bg: #f8fafc;
            --radius: 12px;
            --max-width: 1180px;
        }
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }
        body {
            background: var(--background);
            color: var(--text-main);
            font-family: "Inter", system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        a {
            color: inherit;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        .container {
            width: min(calc(100% - 40px), var(--max-width));
            margin: auto;
        }
        .section {
            padding: 45px 0;
        }
        .section-label {
            color: var(--accent-dark);
            font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        .section-title {
            font-size: clamp(28px, 3.5vw, 44px);
            line-height: 1.1;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }
        .section-intro {
            max-width: 700px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 15px;
        }
        /* =========================================================
           NAVIGATION
        ========================================================= */
        .navbar {
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 1000;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
        }
        .nav-container {
            width: min(calc(100% - 40px), var(--max-width));
            margin: auto;
            min-height: 58px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }
        .brand {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
        }
        .brand-mark {
            width: 30px;
            height: 30px;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            border-radius: 6px;
            background: var(--accent-primary);
            color: #ffffff;
            font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace;
            font-weight: 800;
        }
        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 20px;
        }
        .nav-links a {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: color .2s ease;
        }
        .nav-links a:hover {
            color: var(--accent-primary);
        }
        /* =========================================================
           HERO
        ========================================================= */
        .hero {
            padding: 50px 0 35px;
            position: relative;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%, rgba(224, 242, 254, 0.6), transparent 70%);
        }
        .eyebrow {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 5px 12px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            background: var(--accent-soft);
            border-radius: 999px;
            color: var(--accent-dark);
            font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 600;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        .hero h1 {
            max-width: 900px;
            font-size: clamp(38px, 6vw, 68px);
            line-height: 1.02;
            letter-spacing: -2px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        .hero h1 span {
            color: var(--accent-primary);
        }
        .hero-text {
            max-width: 750px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 17px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .hero-buttons {
            display: flex;
            gap: 12px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }
        .btn {
            padding: 10px 18px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 13px;
            transition: transform .2s ease, background .2s ease;
        }
        .btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }
        .btn-primary {
            background: var(--accent-primary);
            color: #ffffff;
        }
        .btn-secondary {
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            background: var(--background-card);
            color: var(--text-main);
        }
        .hero-stats {
            display: flex;
            gap: 40px;
            margin-top: 30px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }
        .hero-stats div {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }
        .hero-stats strong {
            color: var(--accent-dark);
            font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace;
            font-size: 18px;
        }
        .hero-stats span {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 12px;
        }
        /* =========================================================
           ADVANCED TECHNICAL CONCEPTS (SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE)
        ========================================================= */
        .concepts-section {
            background: var(--background-card);
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-light);
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
        }
        .tech-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: 20px;
            margin-top: 25px;
        }
        .tech-card {
            background: var(--surface-subtle);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .tech-card h3 {
            font-size: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            color: var(--text-main);
        }
        .tech-card p {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }
        .tech-card ul {
            list-style: none;
        }
        .tech-card li {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-bottom: 6px;
            padding-left: 12px;
            position: relative;
        }
        .tech-card li::before {
            content: "•";
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
            color: var(--accent-primary);
        }
        /* =========================================================
           RESUME & TECHNICAL CASE STUDIES
        ========================================================= */
        .resume-section {
            background: var(--background);
        }
        .resume-paper {
            background: var(--background-card);
            color: var(--text-main);
            max-width: 950px;
            margin: 20px auto 0;
            padding: 35px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, .02);
        }
        .resume-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 20px;
            padding-bottom: 16px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border-light);
        }
        .resume-header h2 {
            font-size: 26px;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }
        .resume-title {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 13px;
            margin-top: 2px;
        }
        .resume-contact {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: flex-end;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 12px;
        }
        .resume-block {
            padding: 16px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-light);
        }
        .resume-block:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
            padding-bottom: 0;
        }
        .resume-block > h3 {
            font-size: 11px;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            color: var(--accent-dark);
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .resume-skills {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 6px 20px;
            font-size: 12px;
        }
        .project-resume-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 12px;
        }
        .mini-project {
            padding: 12px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
            border-radius: 8px;
            background: var(--surface-subtle);
        }
        .mini-project strong {
            font-size: 13px;
        }
        .mini-project p {
            margin-top: 4px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 12px;
        }
        /* =========================================================
           ENGINEERING ROADMAP
        ========================================================= */
        .roadmap-section {
            background: var(--background-card);
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-light);
        }
        .roadmap {
            margin-top: 25px;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 16px;
        }
        .roadmap-card {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 60px 1fr;
            gap: 16px;
            padding: 20px;
            background: var(--surface-subtle);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
            border-radius: var(--radius);
        }
        .roadmap-number {
            font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace;
            font-size: 20px;
            color: var(--accent-primary);
        }
        .roadmap-category {
            color: var(--accent-dark);
            font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace;
            font-size: 10px;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
        }
        .roadmap-card h3 {
            margin: 2px 0 4px;
            font-size: 18px;
        }
        .roadmap-card p {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }
        .task-list {
            list-style: none;
        }
        .task-list li {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 8px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }
        .task-list input {
            margin-top: 3px;
            accent-color: var(--accent-primary);
        }
        /* =========================================================
           FOOTER
        ========================================================= */
        footer {
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border-light);
            background: var(--background-card);
            padding: 25px 0;
        }
        .footer-content {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 20px;
        }
        .footer-content strong {
            font-size: 12px;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }
        .footer-content p {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 11px;
            margin-top: 2px;
        }
        .footer-code {
            color: var(--accent-dark);
            font-family: "JetBrains Mono", monospace;
            font-size: 11px;
        }
        /* =========================================================
           RESPONSIVE
        ========================================================= */
        @media (max-width: 950px) {
            .nav-links {
                display: none;
            }
            .tech-grid,
            .roadmap {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }
        @media (max-width: 700px) {
            .section {
                padding: 35px 0;
            }
            .hero {
                padding: 35px 0 25px;
            }
            .hero h1 {
                letter-spacing: -1px;
            }
            .hero-text {
                font-size: 15px;
            }
            .hero-stats {
                gap: 15px;
                margin-top: 20px;
            }
            .resume-paper {
                padding: 20px 14px;
            }
            .resume-header {
                flex-direction: column;
                gap: 10px;
            }
            .resume-contact {
                align-items: flex-start;
            }
            .resume-skills,
            .project-resume-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            .roadmap-card {
                grid-template-columns: 35px 1fr;
                padding: 16px;
            }
            .footer-content {
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: flex-start;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<nav class="navbar">
    <div class="nav-container">
        <div class="brand">
            <span class="brand-mark">TX</span>
            <span>TECH LAUNCH</span>
        </div>
        <div class="nav-links">
            <a href="#concepts">Architecture</a>
            <a href="#resume">Technical Resume</a>
            <a href="#roadmap">Growth Roadmap</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</nav>

<header class="hero">
    <div class="container">
        <span class="eyebrow">PRODUCTION ENGINEERING BLUEPRINT</span>
        <h1>Engineering Beyond <span>Surface UI Code.</span></h1>
        <p class="hero-text">Demonstrating modern browser rendering internals, state architecture, and enterprise Web Vitals optimization without reliance on traditional credentials.</p>
        <div class="hero-buttons">
            <a href="#resume" class="btn btn-primary">Inspect Experience</a>
            <a href="#concepts" class="btn btn-secondary">System Architecture</a>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-stats">
            <div>
                <strong>&lt; 0.1 CLS</strong>
                <span>Zero Layout Shift Target</span>
            </div>
            <div>
                <strong>Web Workers</strong>
                <span>Off-Thread Calculation</span>
            </div>
            <div>
                <strong>WCAG 2.1 AAA</strong>
                <span>Accessible Architecture</span>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</header>

<section id="concepts" class="section concepts-section">
    <div class="container">
        <span class="section-label">ADVANCED ENGINEERING</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Browser Engine & Runtime Mastery</h2>
        <p class="section-intro">Beyond basic syntax: Understanding how browsers parse, render, and execute modern client-side applications at 60 FPS.</p>
        
        <div class="tech-grid">
            <div class="tech-card">
                <h3>Critical Rendering Path</h3>
                <p>Bypassing standard reflow bottlenecks by isolating CSS style mutations to GPU-accelerated compositing layers.</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Eliminating Layout Thrashing</li>
                    <li><code>will-change</code> Hardware Offloading</li>
                    <li>Zero-CLS Asset Preloading</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="tech-card">
                <h3>Asynchronous Execution</h3>
                <p>Preventing long-task blocking on the main thread during heavy data transformations or UI rendering cycles.</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Offloading via Web Workers</li>
                    <li><code>requestIdleCallback</code> Scheduling</li>
                    <li>Microtask Loop Control</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="tech-card">
                <h3>Modular Web Systems</h3>
                <p>Architecting loosely coupled components using standard dynamic imports and native browser Shadow DOM.</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Native Shadow DOM Encapsulation</li>
                    <li>Route-Level Code Splitting</li>
                    <li>Custom Element Life-Cycle Hooks</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="resume" class="section resume-section">
    <div class="container">
        <span class="section-label">TECHNICAL PROFILE</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Production Credentials</h2>
        <div class="resume-paper">
            <div class="resume-header">
                <div>
                    <h2>Technical Candidate</h2>
                    <p class="resume-title">Frontend Systems & Web Performance Specialist</p>
                </div>
                <div class="resume-contact">
                    <span>Austin, Texas</span>
                    <span>candidate@example.com</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="resume-block">
                <h3>ENGINEERING CORE COMPETENCIES</h3>
                <div class="resume-skills">
                    <span>• Render Engine Optimization (LCP/CLS/INP)</span>
                    <span>• Vanilla JavaScript ESNext / Async Pipelines</span>
                    <span>• Semantic DOM Architecture & ARIA Trees</span>
                    <span>• CSS Containment & Custom Property Engines</span>
                    <span>• Build Automation & Bundler Strategy</span>
                    <span>• Automated Lighthouse & Web Vitals CI</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="resume-block">
                <h3>TECHNICAL CASE STUDIES & IMPLEMENTATIONS</h3>
                <div class="project-resume-grid">
                    <div class="mini-project">
                        <strong>Rendering Engine Refactor</strong>
                        <p>Eliminated layout shifts by implementing static aspect-ratio containers and deferred dynamic font loading strategies.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mini-project">
                        <strong>Non-Blocking Worker Migration</strong>
                        <p>Refactored synchronous data transformation pipelines to dedicated Web Workers, dropping main-thread execution locks.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="roadmap" class="section roadmap-section">
    <div class="container">
        <span class="section-label">ENGINEERING MILESTONES</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Production Readiness Roadmap</h2>
        <p class="section-intro">A milestone checklist designed to validate engineering practices for high-scale browser environments.</p>
        
        <div class="roadmap">
            <div class="roadmap-card">
                <div class="roadmap-number">01</div>
                <div>
                    <span class="roadmap-category">SYSTEMS</span>
                    <h3>Core Performance Architecture</h3>
                    <p>Enforce strict Core Web Vitals thresholds during static and dynamic application rendering.</p>
                    <ul class="task-list">
                        <li><input type="checkbox" checked> Target Largest Contentful Paint (LCP) under 1.2s</li>
                        <li><input type="checkbox" checked> Eliminate Cumulative Layout Shift (CLS) via explicit dimensions</li>
                        <li><input type="checkbox"> Implement resource hints (dns-prefetch, modulepreload)</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="roadmap-card">
                <div class="roadmap-number">02</div>
                <div>
                    <span class="roadmap-category">DEPLOYMENT</span>
                    <h3>CI/CD & Accessibility Pipeline</h3>
                    <p>Integrate automated validation for WCAG standards and bundle size thresholds on every commit.</p>
                    <ul class="task-list">
                        <li><input type="checkbox"> Automate Lighthouse performance tests in GitHub Actions</li>
                        <li><input type="checkbox"> Validate ARIA tree accessibility compliance</li>
                        <li><input type="checkbox"> Configure strict tree-shaking on dynamic JS modules</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<footer>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="footer-content">
            <div>
                <strong>TECH LAUNCH SYSTEMS</strong>
                <p>Engineered for high-performance browser execution and modern frontend architecture.</p>
            </div>
            <span class="footer-code">&lt;/&gt; Optimized HTML5 / CSS3 / Vanilla JS</span>
        </div>
    </div>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
